<%# Shared operational header bar — the brand + role block seen at the top-left of every
    Host/Manager mockup (docs/screenshots/Host*.png, Manager*.png). Scoped narrowly to just
    that block for now: the rest of the mockup's header (tab nav, live stat strip, rush mode
    toggle, clock) all depend on real data/features that don't exist yet (Sprint 2+), so
    faking them here would be premature. The border-b gives this room to grow into a full
    bar without restructuring later. %>
<header class="border-b border-roi-border px-6 py-4">
  <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-roi-text">ROI</span>
  <p class="roi-eyebrow mt-0.5"><%= role_label %></p>
</header>
